{
  "slug": "qkconvert",
  "name": "Qkconvert",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "File conversion API - images, audio, documents, data formats, archives, and hashing",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `archive` (Create ZIP archives or inspect ZIP contents using the QkConvert API), `convert-audio` (Convert, trim, merge, split, or normalize audio using the QkConvert API), `convert-data` (Convert between data formats using the QkConvert API), `convert-image` (Convert, resize, optimize, crop, watermark, or batch-process images using the QkConvert API), `hash-file` (Compute cryptographic hashes of a file using the QkConvert API), `process-document` (Process PDF documents using the QkConvert API)\n- **Commands** (1): `status` (Check QkConvert API status, key validity, and account info)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install qkconvert@claude-community` from `Necromunger/qkconvert-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
